# Private or local-only files. All of these are git-ignored, and a CLEAN
# checkout (CI, Coolify) never has them — but a `docker build .` on a
# working machine sends the whole directory, and .next/standalone then
# traces what it finds into the image. Kept in step with .gitignore by
# src/lib/dockerignore-matches-gitignore.test.ts.
HANDOVER-*.md
tmp*.mjs
tmp*.cjs
backups/
fonts-local/
.claude/
.next-verify/
.next-measure/
**/*.local.json
